            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Do we need to keep the old implementation? \r\n\r\nAccording to clason's repeated comments yes (can't find them rn, viva espana).\r\n\r\nAnother important thing: zip plugin is very big, so I will port features little-by-little. Then if we want to replace it that's a decision for later. this pr would provide like 10% of the overall functionality of the zipPlugin",
